# Claude Code ignore patterns
# Files and directories to exclude from Claude's context

# Build outputs
**/build/
**/target/
**/.gradle/
**/bin/
**/out/

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp/

# IDE
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.eclipse/
**/.settings/

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/

# Test reports
**/test-results/
**/test-reports/
**/coverage/

# Temporary files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*~
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# Large files
**/*.jar
**/*.war
**/*.ear
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.pdf
**/*.dmg

# Secrets
.env*
secrets/
**/*secret*
**/*credential*

# Generated docs (optional - uncomment if too large)
# **/static/docs/
# **/build/docs/
